# Cloudflare Workers Assets default Cache-Control is
# `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`. Hashed Vite files are content-
# addressed — long-cache them so mobile Safari does not re-download the
# main graph on every visit. Applied by the asset store itself (see
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# Worker `withHashedAssetCache` is the run_worker_first backup.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
